_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7\n- Not reproducible in 4.6\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable.mono - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on X11 - X11 display driver, Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nCalling `get_line_range()` in 4.6 using the last line results in a value equal to the total char count, while 4.7 results in the total char count + 1 which is out of bounds.\n\nPotentially related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119987\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCall `get_line_range()`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[rtl-line-range-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33314271/rtl-line-range-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124387/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"roc